    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald presents this excellent 2 bed, 2 bath top (2nd) floor apartment with own front door and private stairwell. Boasting large sunny South facing balcony. Set in a popular coastal development on the train / DART line.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises; Private front door and hall at ground floor level with intercom, private stairwell up to the top (2nd floor) that brings you up to the apartment itself. Hall with walk-in hotpress, pull down ladder to attic with plenty of storage space. To the front there is a large open-plan living / dining space with 2 windows overlooking the tree lined cycleway, off this there is a good size kitchen with south facing window. Along the hall there is a full family bathroom, then two double bedrooms, main with good size ensuite. Both bedrooms have glass doors out to the large south facing private balcony. This overlooks the secure, landscaped communal courtyard below. Outside your front door you have your private designated parking space #5 as well as plenty of visitor parking spaces.\n\nLocation is excellent set on the coast between Malahide/Portmarnock to the North and Howth/Sutton to the South along lovely coastal walk / cycleways. Plenty of open green spaces. Plus, you are within minutes walk of both bus stops and train (DART) station. There is a great selection of sports & leisure facilities in the area too."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLanding - \nWelcoming landing area accessed via a private front door at ground floor level. Features a private stairwell leading to the second floor, a useful storage press housing the gas boiler, and a Velux window\n\nHall - 3.65m x 1.0m\nHallway featuring a large hot press, along with a pull-down ladder giving access to the attic space, which benefits from flooring and lighting..\n\nLiving/Dining - 3.75m x 8.80m\nBright and spacious open-plan living/dining room featuring laminate effect timber flooring, ceiling coving, recessed lighting, an ethernet point, and an intercom system. The room flows seamlessly into the kitchen.\n\nKitchen - 2.7m x 2.5m\nFitted high-gloss kitchen featuring granite worktops, tiled flooring, and recessed spot lighting. Integrated appliances include an oven, hob, extractor fan, and fridge freezer, while the kitchen is also plumbed for both a washing machine and dishwasher.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.20m x 3.3m\nSpacious main bedroom featuring fitted wardrobes, carpet flooring, recessed spot lighting, and an ethernet point. A glass door opens directly onto the balcony.\n\nEnsuite - 2.5m x 1.95m\nEn suite featuring a WC, wash hand basin, corner rain shower and extractor fan. Finished with tiled flooring, partially tiled walls and shove lighting.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.05m x 2.85m\nBright and comfortable bedroom featuring fitted wardrobes, an ethernet point and finished with carpet flooring. A glazed door provides direct access to the balcony.\n\nBathroom - 2.2m x 1.75m\nBathroom comprising a WC, wash hand basin, and extractor fan. Finished with tiled flooring, partially tiled walls, and shove lighting.\n\nBalcony - 2.0m x 5.0m\nPrivate south-facing balcony finished with timber decking, metal railings, and outdoor lighting. The balcony overlooks a secure, landscaped communal courtyard with mature planting and paved seating areas.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Top / 2nd Floor 2 bed 2 bath apartment.</li><li>Private front door and stairwell </li><li>Open plan living space </li><li>Private South facing balcony.</li><li>Secure communal courtyard</li><li>Secure designated parking space #5</li><li>uPVC double glazed windows.</li><li>GFCH with new boiler </li><li>Intercom.</li><li>e-Fibre Broadband</li><li>Approx. 78sqm / 840sqft.</li><li>Mgt fee approx. 1,850pa.</ul>"
      },
